"What the hell are you?!{w}All the trash around here
belongs to me, the great me!"{w}{p}"If you're that set on digging through the trash,
hand over 1000 GP!!"{w}

{0E}*           Ahead: the Nerid Marshlands           *
*   Go on, no going back; fall, no climbing out   *
*  Weep and wail, you'll only go round in circles *{0F}{w}

"*chomp*...
...GYAOOOOOOOH!!
Delicious! So delicious I could just die!!"{w}

{0E}*                                                 *
*                     Dead End                    *
*                                                 *{0F}{w}

Deep in the forest was a ferocious-looking Cerberus.{w}Its eyes blazed, and blood was caked around its mouth.
It bared its fangs as if to warn you off.{w}{p}Behind the Cerberus lay a fallen adventurer.{w}They were already dead,
and the knife driven deep into their belly was painful to see.{w}

"Well, well.
Sending it to its grave in its master's embrace...
How very kind of you all."{w}

"The path of evil is a hard one."{w}{p}"Traitors must be dealt with, and when you put
a bounty on the monster the traitor sent out,
some other adventurer goes and snatches it from you."{w}

Once you calm down, you notice something.{w}The Cerberus's mouth is covered in blood,
but the adventurer beyond died of a knife wound.{w}{p}In other words,
it seems this Cerberus wasn't the one who killed them.{w}

"Well, well.
Did you also see Walmitt's request
and come to slay this Cerberus?"{w}

You told them
that it didn't look like the Cerberus
had killed the adventurer.{w}
